expression: run.stdout
---
Encode and decode Base64 (RFC 4648)

Usage: tw base64 [OPTIONS] [FILE]

Arguments:
  [FILE]  Read FILE; - or none for stdin

Options:
  -w, --wrap <N>        Wrap encoded lines after this many characters; 0 for no wrapping
  -d, --decode          Decode Base64 back to bytes
  -i, --ignore-garbage  When decoding, ignore characters outside the Base64 alphabet
  -h, --help            Print help
